\fs36 \cf2 Installation
\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 \
\
Put the \cf4 Delete Imported Duplicates X \cf0 script into the Entourage Script Menu Items folder in the Microsoft User Data folder in the Documents folder of your user folder ("Home") in the Users folder on your OS X hard disk. \
\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\ql\qnatural

